'''Candy''' is a [[Godly_Weapons|godly]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2015 Christmas Knife Box]] during the [[Christmas Event 2015|2015 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
Candy resembles a classic candy cane with red and white stripes, hence the name. Tied to the middle of it is a large red bow tie.   

== Trivia ==
*It is the only knife that has a blunt tip, along with its [[Unique Weapons|unique]] Leaderboard variants: the [[Blue Candy]], [[Bronze Candy]], [[Silver Candy]], and [[Gold Candy]] which were awarded as [[Unique Weapons|Unique]] Trophy Items for placing in the top 100 on the [[Christmas Event 2017]] Leaderboard.
*Its model derives from the now offsale Roblox gear [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/19382057/Candy-Cane Candy Cane] which was modelled and textured by sdev12.
*It was a victim of [[The Duping Glitch (2017)]], causing a loss of value.
*When salvaged, it provides 235 godly [[shards]].
*When equipped, this knife has the player holding the knife at the curl, even though the thumbnail of the item has the curl of the knife facing up.
*It partners with the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun [[Sugar]], creating the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Candy Set|Candy Set]].
*This knife’s description is "When you grow up candy doesn't taste as good, so enjoy it now. And that thing adults say about too much candy giving you a stomach ache is a lie, btw."
*Candy is one of the many candy cane themed godlies (Others being [[Lugercane]], [[Eternalcane]], [[Peppermint]], and [[Minty]]).
*It was the first unboxable Christmas godly in [[Murder Mystery 2]].
*This, [[BattleAxe]], [[BattleAxe II]], [[Bat]], [[Turkey]], [[Evergreen]], [[Heart Wand]], and [[Embersickle]] are the only godly "[[knives]]" that do not resemble knives.

